<div class="clearfix">
	<strong><br /></strong>City Council have meetings on the second and fourth Tuesday of every month. The meetings are open to the public. <br />The agenda for an upcoming meeting is posted on the website and bulletin board at least three (3) business days prior to the meeting.<br /><br />Click <a href= "operations/meetings_and_agendas/index.php">here</a> for agendas for all boards.<br />Click <a href="calendar.php?view=month&amp;month=08&amp;day=01&amp;year=2023" target="_blank">here</a> for calendar and upcoming meetings.<br /><strong><br /><br />Click on the names below to email our current council members:<br /></strong><br />Mayor Pat Kelly<br /><a href="mailto:pkelly@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">pkelly@lowrycrossingtexas.org</a><br /><br />Ward 1<br /><a href="mailto:spitchure@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">Councilman Scott Pitchure</a><br /><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:spitchure@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">pitchure</a><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:spitchure@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">@lowrycrossingtexas.org</a><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:spitchure@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank"></a><br /><a href="mailto:spitchure@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank"></a><br /><a href="mailto:cmadrid@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">Councilman Chris Madrid - Treasurer</a><br /><a href="mailto:cmadrid@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">cmadrid</a><a href="mailto:cmadrid@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">@lowrycrossingtexas.org</a><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:cmadrid@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank"></a><br /><br />Ward 2<br /><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:thodges@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">Councilwoman Tammy Hodges, Mayor Pro Tem</a><br /><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:thodges@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">thodges</a><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:thodges@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">@lowrycrossingtexas.org</a><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:thodges@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank"></a><a href="mailto:cmadrid@lowrycrossingtexas.org"><br /></a><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:pchristian@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank"></a><a href="mailto:cmadrid@lowrycrossingtexas.org"><br /></a><a href="mailto:agur@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">Councilman Agur Rios</a><br /><a href="operations/councilman_agur_rios.php" target="_self">Councilman Agur Rios</a><br /><br />Ward 3<br /><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:etrujillo@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">Councilman Eusebio "Joe" Trujillo III </a><br /><a href="mailto:etrujillo@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">etrujillo</a><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:etrujillo@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">@lowrycrossingtexas.org</a><a href="mailto:cmadrid@lowrycrossingtexas.org"><br /></a><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:etrujillo@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank"></a><a href="mailto:cmadrid@lowrycrossingtexas.org"><br /></a><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:ccash@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">Councilwoman Cindy Cash</a><br /><a href="mailto:ccash@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">ccash</a><a rel="noopener" href="mailto:ccash@lowrycrossingtexas.org" target="_blank">@lowrycrossingtexas.org</a><br /><br />Ward 4<br /><a href="mailto:ghijazen@lowrycrossingtexas.com" target="_blank">Councilman Muhanad (G) Hijazen</a><br /><a href="mailto:ghijazen@lowrycrossingtexas.com" target="_blank">Ghijazen@lowrycrossingtexas.com</a><br /><br /><a href="mailto:osimpson@lowrycrossingtexas.com" target="_blank">Councilman Ollie Simpson</a><br /><a href="mailto:osimpson@lowrycrossingtexas.com" target="_blank">osimpson@lowrycrossingtexas.com</a>
